 "case:tagline": "Forty people boarded the last ferry off the island. Thirty-nine got off.",
 "case:timeline.conclusion": "Nell never left St Ebba’s. Just before four she walked out to the Churn to meet someone, and she died there, while the birders chased the bird and the boat came in. Twenty minutes later, at the Landing, somebody with her phone in their pocket told Tom to get on and save her a seat. Her ticket went aboard on his phone, and a boat with forty tickets sailed with thirty-nine people.",
